[h2]Build 0.9.4[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The power suit frame is redrawn to match the warcaskets of Vanilla Factions Expanded - Pirates: chunky armour plates with heavy outlines, a domed helmet with round eye lenses, a breather snout and cheek filters, big rounded pauldrons, and the power cell housing on the back.
[*]Power suits now come in paint jobs - olive drab, gunmetal, desert and rust red - and can be recoloured like other apparel.
[*]The suit is drawn at the same size as a warcasket, and fits every body type the same way.
[/list]
